   "id": 615463,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A vocal antislavery movement developed in Boston because ",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1169824,
     "content_html": "the city of Boston and the state of Massachusetts had little connection to the development of slavery in the United States\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169825,
     "content_html": "the free black community, transcendentalist writers, and Unitarian ministers supported abolition\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169823,
     "content_html": "Boston’s Democratic Party polled an overwhelming majority in national elections\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169822,
     "content_html": "very few African Americans lived in the Boston area\n"
    }
   ],
